      "english": "You got all the answers wrong"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸在给小明改作业，他一边看答案，一边改。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸在給小明改作業，他一邊看答案，一邊改。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba zài gěi xiǎo míng gǎi zuò yè tā yì biān kàn dá àn yì biān gǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's dad was correcting Little Ming's homework, looking at the answers while correcting."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "改完后，爸爸很生气地对小明说：“你全错了！”",
      "traditional": "改完後，爸爸很生氣地對小明說：“你全錯了！”",
      "pinyin": "gǎi wán hòu bà ba hěn shēng qì de duì xiǎo míng shuō nǐ quán cuò le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "After he finished correcting, dad angrily said to Little Ming: “You got all the answers wrong!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明问：“爸爸，你会不会看错答案了？”",
      "traditional": "小明問：“爸爸，你會不會看錯答案了？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wèn bà ba nǐ huì bú huì kàn cuò dá àn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming asked: “Dad, is it possible that you misread the answers?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明爸爸仔细看了看，真的是看错答案了，",
      "traditional": "小明爸爸仔細看了看，真的是看錯答案了，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà ba zǐ xì kàn le kàn zhēn de shì kàn cuò dá àn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "他又重新改了一遍作业。",
      "traditional": "他又重新改了一遍作業。",
      "pinyin": "tā yòu chóng xīn gǎi le yí biàn zuò yè",
      "english": "Little Ming's dad looked carefully, and saw that he really had misread the answers."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He corrected the homework once again."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "过了一会儿，爸爸更生气了，说：“重新改了一遍，你还是全错了！”",
      "traditional": "過了一會兒，爸爸更生氣了，說：“重新改了一遍，你還是全錯了！”",
      "pinyin": "guò le yí huì'r bà ba gèng shēng qì le shuō chóng xīn gǎi le yí biàn nǐ hái shì quán cuò le",
