      "You got all the answers wrong",
      "",
      "Little Ming's dad was correcting Little Ming's homework, looking at the answers while correcting.",
      "",
      "After he finished correcting, dad angrily said to Little Ming: “You got all the answers wrong!”",
      "",
      "Little Ming asked: “Dad, is it possible that you misread the answers?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming's dad looked carefully, and saw that he really had misread the answers.",
      "He corrected the homework once again.",
      "",
      "After a while, dad got even more angry and said: “I corrected once again, but you still have all answers wrong!”"
